    "finalName": "",
    "description": "Your outsider status makes you cautious, observant, and ready for action. If an enemy fails a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Stealth\" title=\"Stealth\">Stealth</a> or a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Deception\" title=\"Deception\">Deception</a> check opposed by your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Perception\" title=\"Perception\">Perception</a> check, you can take one <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Move_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Move Action\">Move Action</a> as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reaction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction\">Reaction</a>. If multiple enemies fail on the same turn (such as when you detect several enemies sneaking up on you), the number of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Move_Actions\" title=\"Move Actions\">Move Actions</a> you take cannot exceed your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> modifier (minimum 1).",
